    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University's Department of Community Health Sciences (CHS) organised 12 theatre shows for school-going children at the Arts Council of Pakistan, where over 4000 students between the ages of 11 to 15 from The Citizen Foundation, Zindagi Trust, and numerous private and government schools eagerly attended the play, accompanied by their teachers and staff.",
